# TASK-27 9f, the final step: NetSurf on the real Wikipedia (ru and uk), through
# QEMU's user network to the real Internet. A hand-run script: it is in no CI
# list; `make hand-netsurf-wikipedia` runs it. It only takes screens (build/shots/);
# no region is asserted, since the sites change. Each page gets a long wait and two
# screens (the second one after more time, for the images of upload.wikimedia.org).
serial init: gui: gpu on its own page
screen Type help to begin, or help tour.
screen ~> _
pause 3000
type netsurf https://ru.wikipedia.org/\r
pause 45000
shot wp-ru-front-a
pause 60000
shot wp-ru-front-b
click 122 119
pause 3000
click 300 87
pause 500
type netsurf https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%9C%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B2%D0%B0\r
pause 60000
shot wp-ru-article-a
pause 90000
shot wp-ru-article-b
click 122 119
pause 3000
click 300 87
pause 500
type netsurf https://uk.wikipedia.org/\r
pause 45000
shot wp-uk-front-a
pause 60000
shot wp-uk-front-b
click 122 119
pause 3000
click 300 87
pause 500
type netsurf https://uk.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%9A%D0%B8%D1%97%D0%B2\r
pause 60000
shot wp-uk-article-a
pause 90000
shot wp-uk-article-b
click 122 119
pause 3000
click 300 87
pause 500
type echo closed\r
screen closed
type poweroff\r
exit
